1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,893
BA ke baad bhi gaon mein berozgaar hoon. Kheti mein bhi kuch naya nahi.

2
00:00:05,193 --> 00:00:10,904
Sunil, kheti mein sabse naya hai drone! Kisaanon ke khet mein drone se chhidkaav kar!

3
00:00:11,204 --> 00:00:15,336
Drone udaana? Doctor sahab, uske liye to license lagta hai!

4
00:00:15,636 --> 00:00:24,519
Haan, DGCA se remote pilot certificate le. Drone aur training, lagbhag 7 lakh. Subsidy aur loan bhi milta hai.

5
00:00:24,819 --> 00:00:30,025
Ek ekad ka chhidkaav, bas 7-8 minute mein. Aur dawa bhi kam lagti hai.

6
00:00:30,575 --> 00:00:36,088
Sunil, dhaan mein keeda lag gaya! Mazdoor nahi mil rahe, jaldi chhidkaav karo!

7
00:00:36,388 --> 00:00:40,047
Das ekad, dedh ghante mein khatam! 400 rupaye ekad, Tau.

8
00:00:40,347 --> 00:00:44,418
Season mein roz 20 ekad, yaani 8 hazaar ki kamai.

9
00:00:44,718 --> 00:00:49,789
Phir doosre ladkon ko training dekar drone team bana. Poora zila tera!

10
00:00:50,089 --> 00:00:52,648
Aasmaan se kamai! Sunil ki life set!
